<title>SPAIN: BCH participates in Iberia-Airbus plan.</title>
<headline>BCH participates in Iberia-Airbus plan.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Central Hispano said on Thursday it had received a mandate from Iberia-Airbus Industrie consortium to help finance two Airbus A340 planes in October.</p>
<p>The deal is for $218 million. Of the total amount, $158 million dollars will be provided by the European Investment Bank.</p>
<p>The financing is guaranteed by a syndicate of banks comprised of BCH, Popular, Commerzbank AG's Spanish unit and Kreditanstalt fuer Wiederaufbau.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
